ve-inc-crwv-investors-with-substantial-losses-have-opportunity-to-lead-the-coreweave-class-action-lawsuit--hagens-berman-302673274.html\"},{\"title\":\"AI Infrastructure Company Hit with AI-Related Securities Suit | The D&O Diary\",\"url\":\"https://www.dandodiary.com/2026/01/articles/artificial-intelligence/ai-infrastructure-company-hit-with-ai-related-securities-suit/\"},{\"title\":\"CoreWeave Faces Lawsuits As Nvidia Investment Reframes AI Infrastructure Story\",\"url\":\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/coreweave-faces-lawsuits-nvidia-investment-021232801.html\"},{\"title\":\"CRWV SHAREHOLDERS: CoreWeave, Inc. Accused of Misrepresentations about its Infrastructure in Securities Fraud Class Action – Investors Notified to Contact BFA Law\",\"url\":\"https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2026/01/26/3225660/0/en/CRWV-SHAREHOLDERS-CoreWeave-Inc-Accused-of-Misrepresentations-about-its-Infrastructure-in-Securities-Fraud-Class-Action-Investors-Notified-to-Contact-BFA-Law.html\"},{\"title\":\"CRWV INVESTOR NOTICE: CoreWeave, Inc. Investors with Substantial Losses Have Opportunity to Lead the CoreWeave Class Action Lawsuit\",\"url\":\"https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2026/01/19/3221221/32716/en/CRWV-INVESTOR-NOTICE-CoreWeave-Inc-Investors-with-Substantial-Losses-Have-Opportunity-to-Lead-the-CoreWeave-Class-Action-Lawsuit.html\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found about the CoreWeave securities lawsuit:\n\n## Overview\n\nA class action lawsuit has been filed against CoreWeave, Inc. and certain officers, announced in January 2026. The class action, filed in the United States District Court for the Western District of Texas, is on behalf of all persons who purchased or otherwise acquired CoreWeave securities between March 28, 2025 and December 15, 2025.\n\n## Key Allegations\n\nCoreWeave overstated its ability to meet customer demand and concealed significant construction delays at its data centers. More specifically, CoreWeave overstated its capacity to satisfy \"robust\" customer demand and downplayed the severe operational risks posed by its heavy reliance on a single third-party data center supplier.\n\n## Stock Performance Impact\n\nFollowing revelations that a critical Denton, Texas data center cluster was months behind schedule, CoreWeave's market capitalization plummeted by approximately $14 billion. On November 10, 2025, CoreWeave lowered guidance and the price of CoreWeave stock dropped $17.22 per share, or more than 16%.\n\n## Legal Details\n\nThe complaint asserts claims under Sections 10(b) and 20(a) of the Securities Exchange Act of 1934. Investors have until March 13, 2026, to ask the Court to be appointed to lead the case.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ecff7720-544d-482b-91e9-9eb1a0db0dee","uuid":"90e46eb7-da86-4d62-831b-0affa7a5f162","tool_use_result":{"query":"CoreWeave securities lawsuit AI infrastructure January 2026 class action","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01EChLpcZHsCsKPLXBmYti4z","content":[{"title":"CoreWeave Securities Litigation: When AI Ambitions Collide With Construction Timelines - TipRanks.com","url":"https://www.tipranks.com/news/class-action/coreweave-securities-litigation-when-ai-ambitions-collide-with-construction-timelines"},{"title":"CRWV LOSS NOTICE: CoreWeave, Inc. Plummets 16% Triggering Securities Fraud Class Action, Investors Notified to Contact BFA Law by March 13","url":"https://www.newsfilecorp.com/release/281953/CRWV-LOSS-NOTICE-CoreWeave-Inc.-Plummets-16-Triggering-Securities-Fraud-Class-Action-Investors-Notified-to-Contact-BFA-Law-by-March-13"},{"title":"CoreWeave, Inc. (CRWV) Class Action Lawsuit - Bleichmar Fonti & Auld LLP","url":"https://www.bfalaw.com/cases/coreweave-inc-class-action-lawsuit"},{"title":"Pomerantz Law Firm Announces the Filing of a Class Action Against CoreWeave, Inc. and Certain Officers - CRWV","url":"https://