[2026-02-04T17:19:45.247Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Avr4bL8B9YP9RnYZHgHqJZ","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Apple AI lawsuit securities fraud Siri iPhone 16 stock drop $900 billion 2025\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Apple faces massive fraud lawsuit over Siri AI claims\",\"url\":\"https://rollingout.com/2025/08/06/apple-fraud-lawsuit-over-siri-ai-claims/\"},{\"title\":\"Investor Lawsuit Targets Apple’s “Misleading” AI Venture\",\"url\":\"https://www.thefashionlaw.com/investor-lawsuit-targets-apple-misleading-claims-about-ai-venture/\"},{\"title\":\"Apple sued after Siri AI delay triggers $900B market value loss\",\"url\":\"https://interestingengineering.com/culture/siri-ai-delays-trigger-apple-lawsuit\"},{\"title\":\"Class action alleges Apple misled investors about Siri’s AI capabilities\",\"url\":\"https://topclassactions.com/lawsuit-settlements/lawsuit-news/class-action-alleges-apple-misled-investors-about-siris-ai-capabilities/\"},{\"title\":\"AAPL CLASS ACTION NOTICE: Apple Inc. has been Sued for Securities Fraud relating to its AI Rollout – Investors are Notified to Contact BFA Law by August 19 (NASDAQ:AAPL)\",\"url\":\"https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2025/06/24/3104203/0/en/AAPL-CLASS-ACTION-NOTICE-Apple-Inc-has-been-Sued-for-Securities-Fraud-relating-to-its-AI-Rollout-Investors-are-Notified-to-Contact-BFA-Law-by-August-19-NASDAQ-AAPL.html\"},{\"title\":\"Apple's delayed Siri update spawns another securities lawsuit\",\"url\":\"https://appleinsider.com/articles/25/07/29/apples-delayed-siri-update-spawns-another-securities-lawsuit\"},{\"title\":\"AAPL FRAUD REMINDER: Apple Inc. Stock Drop Triggers Securities Fraud Class Action – Contact BFA Law before Imminent August 19 Deadline (NASDAQ:AAPL)\",\"url\":\"https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2025/08/15/3134206/0/en/AAPL-FRAUD-REMINDER-Apple-Inc-Stock-Drop-Triggers-Securities-Fraud-Class-Action-Contact-BFA-Law-before-Imminent-August-19-Deadline-NASDAQ-AAPL.html\"},{\"title\":\"AAPL SECURITIES FRAUD: Apple Inc. (NASDAQ:AAPL) Stock Drop Triggers Class Action Lawsuit – Contact BFA Law by August 19 Legal Deadline\",\"url\":\"https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2025/07/18/3117933/0/en/AAPL-SECURITIES-FRAUD-Apple-Inc-NASDAQ-AAPL-Stock-Drop-Triggers-Class-Action-Lawsuit-Contact-BFA-Law-by-August-19-Legal-Deadline.html\"},{\"title\":\"Apple's Legal Crossroads: Can the Stock Withstand the Siri Lawsuit Storm?\",\"url\":\"https://www.ainvest.com/news/apple-legal-crossroads-stock-withstand-siri-lawsuit-storm-2507/\"},{\"title\":\"AAPL LAWSUIT: Apple Inc. Sued for Fraud over AI Promises to Investors – Contact BFA Law by August 19 Court Deadline (NASDAQ: AAPL)\",\"url\":\"https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2025/07/28/3122482/0/en/AAPL-LAWSUIT-Apple-Inc-Sued-for-Fraud-over-AI-Promises-to-Investors-Contact-BFA-Law-by-August-19-Court-Deadline-NASDAQ-AAPL.html\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found about the Apple AI lawsuit:\n\n## Apple Securities Fraud Lawsuit Over Siri AI\n\nApple Inc. is facing a securities class action lawsuit in the Northern District of California, stemming from its public rollout and marketing of advanced AI features – particularly those tied to Siri – at its 2024 Worldwide Developers Conference (\"WWDC\").\n\n### Key Claims\n\nAccording to the complaint filed on June 20 by Apple shareholder Eric Tucker, Apple and key executives misled shareholders by touting non-existent or undeveloped Siri capabilities to boost iPhone 16 sales, inflating the company's stock price in the process.\n\nThe technology was marketed as a generative-AI-powered enhancement of Siri – Apple's digital assistant – promising context-aware capabilities, cross-app actions, and improved natural language processing. However, Apple allegedly lacked a functional prototype of these features at the time and had no reasonable basis to believe it could deliver them within the iPhone 16 product cycle, if ever.\n\n### Stock Impact\n\nThe price of Apple stock declined $2.47 per share, or over 1%, from $203.92 on June 6, 2025, to $201.45 per share on June 9, 2025 following the underwhelming 2025 WWDC announcement. Additionally, on March 7, 2025, Apple admitted the AI-Siri features were delayed indefinitely, triggering a 4.85% stock drop to $227.48, and on April 3, 2025, a Wall Street Journal exposé caused a 7.28% plunge to $188.13.\n\n### About the $900 Billion Figure\n\nThe search results mention that the law firm recovered over $900 million from Tesla's Board of Directors in a previous case, but this refers to past settlements, not a current $900 billion drop tied to this lawsuit specifically.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ecff7720-544d-482b-91e9-9eb1a0db0dee","uuid":"2901ce0a-508d-4da9-a617-9be77e2b4b71","tool_use_result":{"query":"Apple AI lawsuit securities fraud Siri iPhone 16 stock drop $900 billion 2025","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01K4heLKxzU4Udunedvav5Pb","content":[{"title":"Apple faces massive fraud lawsuit over Siri AI claims","url":"https://rollingout.com/2025/08/06/apple-fraud-lawsuit-over-siri-ai-claims/"},{"title":"Investor Lawsuit Targets Apple’s “Misleading” AI Venture","url":"https://www.thefashionlaw.com/investor-lawsuit-targets-apple-misleading-claims-about-ai-venture/"},{"title":"Apple sued after Siri AI delay triggers $900B market value loss","url":"https://interestingengineering.com/culture/siri-ai-delays-trigger-apple-lawsuit"},{"title":"Class action alleges Apple misled investors about Siri’s AI capabilities","url":"https://topclassactions.com/lawsuit-settlements/lawsuit-news/class-action-alleges-apple-misled-investors-about-siris-ai-capabilities/"},{"title":"AAPL CLASS ACTION NOTICE: Apple Inc. has been Sued for Securities Fraud relating to its AI Rollout – Investors are Notified to 