[2026-02-04T17:19:57.631Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DWndsVstXCos6VY1aHtpgq","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Richtech Robotics AI-washing securities lawsuit Microsoft collaboration stock pump February 2026\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Securities Suit Alleges AI-Washing Stock Price \\\"Pump\\\" | The D&O Diary\",\"url\":\"https://www.dandodiary.com/2026/02/articles/securities-litigation/securities-suit-alleges-ai-washing-stock-price-pump/\"},{\"title\":\"Investor Notice: Shareholder Rights Law Firm Robbins LLP Informs Investors of the Richtech Robotics Inc. Securities Class Action Lawsuit | MarketScreener\",\"url\":\"https://www.marketscreener.com/news/investor-notice-shareholder-rights-law-firm-robbins-llp-informs-investors-of-the-richtech-robotics-ce7e5bd2da8ff12d\"},{\"title\":\"RR INVESTOR ALERT: Richtech Robotics Inc. Investors with Substantial Losses Have Opportunity to Lead the Richtech Robotics Class Action Lawsuit\",\"url\":\"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/rr-investor-alert-richtech-robotics-inc-investors-with-substantial-losses-have-opportunity-to-lead-the-richtech-robotics-class-action-lawsuit-302676900.html\"},{\"title\":\"BREAKING: Richtech Robotics Investigated for Securities Fraud Following 20% Drop; Investors Should Contact Block & Leviton to Potentially Recover Losses\",\"url\":\"https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2026/01/29/3229056/23044/en/BREAKING-Richtech-Robotics-Investigated-for-Securities-Fraud-Following-20-Drop-Investors-Should-Contact-Block-Leviton-to-Potentially-Recover-Losses.html\"},{\"title\":\"RR Stockholder Alert: Robbins LLP Reminds Investors of the Class Action Lawsuit Against Richtech Robotics Inc.\",\"url\":\"http://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/rr-stockholder-alert-robbins-llp-reminds-investors-of-the-class-action-lawsuit-against-richtech-robotics-inc-302678158.html\"},{\"title\":\"Investor Notice: Shareholder Rights Law Firm Robbins LLP Informs Investors of the Richtech Robotics Inc. Securities Class Action Lawsuit | The AI Journal\",\"url\":\"https://aijourn.com/investor-notice-shareholder-rights-law-firm-robbins-llp-informs-investors-of-the-richtech-robotics-inc-securities-class-action-lawsuit/\"},{\"title\":\"BREAKING: Richtech Robotics Sued for Securities Fraud; Investors Should Contact Block & Leviton to Recover Losses | MarketScreener\",\"url\":\"https://www.marketscreener.com/news/breaking-richtech-robotics-sued-for-securities-fraud-investors-should-contact-block-leviton-to-r-ce7e5bd3db8ffe20\"},{\"title\":\"Investor Notice: Shareholder Rights Law Firm Robbins LLP Informs Investors of the Richtech Robotics Inc. Securities Class Action Lawsuit\",\"url\":\"https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20260202266054/en/Investor-Notice-Shareholder-Rights-Law-Firm-Robbins-LLP-Informs-Investors-of-the-Richtech-Robotics-Inc.-Securities-Class-Action-Lawsuit\"},{\"title\":\"Richtech Robotics Inc. Under Investigation After 20% Stock Drop | MarketScreener\",\"url\":\"https://www.marketscreener.com/news/richtech-robotics-inc-under-investigation-after-20-stock-drop-ce7e5bdfde88ff24\"},{\"title\":\"Richtech Robotics Inc. Under Investigation After 20% Stock Drop | Morningstar\",\"url\":\"https://www.morningstar.com/news/business-wire/20260129263516/richtech-robotics-inc-under-investigation-after-20-stock-drop\"}]\n\nBased on the web search results, here's a comprehensive overview of the Richtech Robotics AI-washing securities lawsuit:\n\n## Summary of the Case\n\nThe lawsuit alleges that the defendant company used the announcement of a supposed AI-related \"collaboration\" with Microsoft to \"pump\" the company's share price just before disclosing an at-the-market private placement.\n\n## Timeline of Events\n\nOn January 27, 2026, Richtech Robotics issued a press release announcing \"a hands-on collaboration with Microsoft through the Microsoft AI Co-Innovation Labs to jointly develop and deploy agentic artificial intelligence capabilities.\" The company's share price rose over 44% on this news.\n\nOn January 28, 2026, at 8:00 AM EST, Richtech issued a press release announcing a $38.7 million private placement priced at-the-market, expected to close on January 29, 2026.\n\nOn January 29, 2026, Hunterbrook Media published a report entitled \"Breaking: Microsoft Denies Partnership with Richtech Robotics,\" which claimed that the agreement with Richtech was a \"standard\" customer program with \"no commercial element.\" On this news Richtech Class B common stock fell 20.87% on January 29, 2026, and fell a further 10.9% the following day.\n\n## Core Allegations\n\nThe complaint alleges that during the class period, the defendants made false or misleading statements or failed to disclose that \"(1) Richtech claimed that it had a collaborative and commercial relationship with Microsoft when it did not; and (2) as a result, Defendants' statements about Richtech's business, operations, and prospects, were materially false and misleading and/or lacked a reasonable basis at all times.\"\n\n## Legal Status\n\nA class action was filed on behalf of all investors who purchased or otherwise acquired Richtech Robotics Inc. (NASDAQ: RR) securities between January 27, 2026 and 12:00 PM EST on January 29, 2026.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ecff7720-544d-482b-91e9-9eb1a0db0dee","uuid":"0ac14162-1cb6-44ba-b464-13b9a75fcc83","tool_use_result":{"query":"Richtech Robotics AI-washing securities lawsuit Microsoft collaboration stock pump February 2026","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01XtQcb5DsgrJWg2hnNAxj2U","content":[{"title":"Securities Suit Alleges AI-Washing Stock Price \"Pump\" | The D&O Diary","url":"https://www.dandodiary.com/2026/02/articles/securities-litigation/securities-suit-alleges-ai-washing-stock-price-pump/"},{"title":"Investor Notice: Shareholder Rights Law Firm Robbins LLP Informs Investors of the Richtech Robotics Inc. Securities Class Action Lawsuit | MarketScreener","url":"https://www.marketscreener.com/news/investor-notice-shareholder-rights-law-firm-robbins-llp-informs-investors-of-the-richtech-robotics-ce7e5bd2da8ff12d"},{"title":"RR INVESTOR ALERT: Richtech Robotics Inc. Investors with Substantial Losses Have Opportunity to Lead the Richtech Robotics Class Action Lawsuit","url":"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/rr-investor-alert-richtech-robotics-inc-investors-with-substantial-losses-have-opportunity-to-lead-the-richtech-robotics-class-action-lawsuit-302676900.html"},{"title":"BREAKING: Richtech Robotics Investigated for Securities Fraud Following 20% Drop; Investors Should Contact Block & Leviton to Potentially Recover Losses","url":"https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2026/01/29/3229056/23044/en/BREAKING-Richtech-Robotics-Investigated-for-Securities-Fraud-Following-20-Drop-Investors-Should-Contact-Block-Leviton-to-Potentially-Recover-Losses.html"},{"title":"RR Stockholder Alert: Robbins LLP Reminds Investors of the Class Action Lawsuit Against Richtech Robotics Inc.","url":"http://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/rr-stockholder-alert-robbins-llp-reminds-investors-of-the-class-action-lawsuit-against-richtech-robotics-inc-302678158.html"},{"title":"Investor Notice: Shareholder Rights Law Firm Robbins LLP Informs Investors of the Richtech Robotics Inc. Securities Class Action Lawsuit | The AI Journal","url":"https://aijourn.com/investor-notice-shareholder-rights-law-firm-robbins-llp-informs-investors-of-the-richtech-robotics-inc-securities-class-action-lawsuit/"},{"title":"BREAKING: Richtech Robotics Sued for Securities Fraud; Investors Should Contact Block & Leviton to Recover Losses | MarketScreener","url":"https://www.marketscreener.com/news/breaking-richtech-robotics-sued-for-securities-fraud-investors-should-contact-block-leviton-to-r-ce7e5bd3db8ffe20"},{"title":"Investor Notice: Shareholder Rights Law Firm Robbins LLP Informs Investors of the Richtech Robotics Inc. Securities Class Action Lawsuit","url":"https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20260202266054/en/Investor-Notice-Shareholder-Rights-Law-Firm-Robbins-LLP-Informs-Investors-of-the-Richtech-Robotics-Inc.-Securities-Class-Action-Lawsuit"},{"title":"Richtech Robotics Inc. Under Investigation After 20% Stock Drop | MarketScreener","url":"https://www.marketscreener.com/news/richtech-robotics-inc-under-investigation-after-20-stock-drop-ce7e5bdfde88ff24"},{"title":"Richtech Robotics Inc. Under Investigation After 20% Stock Drop | Morningstar","url":"https://www.morningstar.com/news/business-wire/20260129263516/richtech-robotics-inc-under-investigation-after-20-stock-drop"}]},"Based on the web search results, here's a comprehensive overview of the Richtech Robotics AI-washing securities lawsuit:\n\n## Summary of the Case\n\nThe lawsuit alleges that the defendant company used the announcement of a supposed AI-related \"collaboration\" with Microsoft to \"pump\" the company's share price just before disclosing an at-the-market private placement.\n\n## Timeline of Events\n\nOn January 27, 2026, Richtech Robotics issued a press release announcing \"a hands-on collaboration with Microsoft through the Microsoft AI Co-Innovation Labs to jointly develop and deploy agentic artificial intelligence capabilities.\" The company's share price rose over 44% on this news.\n\nOn January 28, 2026, at 8:00 AM EST, Richtech issued a press release announcing a $38.7 million private placement priced at-the-market, expected to close on January 29, 2026.\n\nOn January 29, 2026, Hunterbrook Media published a report entitled \"Breaking: Microsoft Denies Partnership with Richtech Robotics,\" which claimed that the agreement with Richtech was a \"standard\" customer program with \"no commercial element.\" On this news Richtech Class B common stock fell 20.87% on January 29, 2026, and fell a further 10.9% the following day.\n\n## Core Allegations\n\nThe complaint alleges that during the class period, the defendants made false or misleading statements or failed to disclose that \"(1) Richtech claimed that it had a collaborative and commercial relationship with Microsoft when it did not; and (2) as a result, Defendants' statements about Richtech's business, operations, and prospects, were materially false and misleading and/or lacked a reasonable basis at all times.\"\n\n## Legal Status\n\nA class action was filed on behalf of all investors who purchased or otherwise acquired Richtech Robotics Inc. (NASDAQ: RR) securities between January 27, 2026 and 12:00 PM EST on January 29, 2026."],"durationSeconds":9.122867799999993}}
[2026-02-04T17:19:58.486Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TiP4bq2BbJyBRsA9LRA7Pc","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"\"AI-washing\" lawsuit settlements 2024 2025 Delphia Global Predictions Nate Inc SEC FTC\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"AI Washing: How Exaggerating Your (Artificial) Intelligence Can Get You and Your Business in Trouble\",\"url\":\"https://www.bfvlaw.com/ai-washing-how-exaggerating-your-artificial-intelligence-can-get-you-and-your-business-in-trouble/\"},{\"title\":\"Two Companies Hit with Separate AI-Washing Securities Lawsuits | The D&O Diary\",\"url\":\"https://www.dandodiary.com/2025/03/articles/securities-litigation/two-companies-hit-with-separate-ai-washing-securities-lawsuits/\"},{\"title\":\"Darrow · AI Washing Sparks Investor Suits and SEC Scrutiny\",\"url\":\"https://www.darrow.ai/resources/ai-washing\"},{\"title\":\"AI-related securities class action filings are on the rise: Key observations | DLA Piper\",\"url\":\"https://www.dlapiper.com/en-us/insights/publications/2025/09/ai-related-securities-class-action-filings-are-on-the-rise-key-observations\"},{\"title\":\"SEC emphasizes focus on “AI washing” despite perceived enforcement slowdown | DLA Piper\",\"url\":\"https://www.dlapiper.com/en/insights/publications/ai-outlook/2025/sec-emphasizes-focus-on-ai-washing\"},{\"title\":\"Federal 'AI washing' enforcement likely to continue\",\"url\":\"https://www.legaldive.com/news/federal-ai-washing-enforcement-likely-to-continue/738938/\"},{\"title\":\"More buzz than sting: The state of AI-related securities litigation\",\"url\":\"https://www.wtwco.com/en-us/insights/2025/11/more-buzz-than-sting-the-state-of-ai-related-securities-litigation\"},{\"title\":\"AI Washing: Regulatory Scrutiny and Investor Lawsuits on the Rise\",\"url\":\"https://natlawreview.com/article/what-ai-washing-and-why-are-companies-getting-sued\"},{\"title\":\"Year in Review: 2024 AI Securities Litigation Trends\",\"url\":\"https://www.wilmerhale.com/en/insights/blogs/wilmerhale-privacy-and-cybersecurity-law/20250331-year-in-review-2024-ai-securities-litigation-trends\"},{\"title\":\"Decoding the SEC’s First “AI-Washing” Enforcement Actions\",\"url\":\"https://corpgov.law.harvard.edu/2024/04/18/decoding-the-secs-first-ai-washing-enforcement-actions/\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found regarding AI-washing lawsuit settlements and enforcement actions in 2024-2025:\n\n## SEC Enforcement Actions\n\nIn 2024, the SEC accused two investment firms, Delphia (USA) Inc. and Global Predictions Inc., of making false and misleading statements in SEC filings, press releases, and social media posts regarding the use of AI to predict market growth for investments. Delphia had to pay a civil penalty of $225,000 and Global Predictions had to pay $175,000 for the violations.\n\nIn March 2024, Delphia and Global Predictions settled charges after falsely claiming to use sophisticated AI-driven investing models—one even promoted itself as the \"first regulated AI financial advisor.\"\n\n## FTC Enforcement Actions\n\nThe FTC filed a complaint against DoNotPay, Inc., an online legal service company, for claiming to provide an AI program that would serve as a substitute for a human lawyer. DoNotPay had to pay $193,000 in refunds to consumers who used its products.\n\nA proposed settlement order entered in June 2025 would require Ascend to turn over assets and cease improper business actions, and the order also contains a partially suspended $25 million monetary judgment.\n\n## Nate, Inc. Case\n\nKate Zoladz, Deputy Enforcement Division Director for the West region, highlighted the still-pending Nate, Inc. case. The Department of Justice and the SEC have demonstrated a willingness to bring parallel criminal and civil actions where AI representations go beyond puffery and cross into deception.\n\n## Securities Class Actions\n\nWhile there were 7 securities class action cases related to AI disclosures filed in 2023, that number doubled to 14 in 2024, and 12 have been filed so far in 2025.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ecff7720-544d-482b-91e9-9eb1a0db0dee","uuid":"df46a6d4-f767-4caf-a606-c919da15a3c5","tool_use_result":{"query":"\"AI-washing\" lawsuit settlements 2024 2025 Delphia Global Predictions Nate Inc SEC FTC","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01CgJfabBHbma9ZNPvnzzN9u","content":[{"title":"AI Washing: How Exaggerating Your (Artificial) Intelligence Can Get You and Your Business in Trouble","url":"https://www.bfvlaw.com/ai-washing-how-exaggerating-your-artificial-intelligence-can-get-you-and-your-business-in-trouble/"},{"title":"Two Companies Hit with Separate AI-Washing Securities Lawsuits | The D&O Diary","url":"https://www.dandodiary.com/2025/03/articles/securities-litigation/two-companies-hit-with-separate-ai-washing-securities-lawsuits/"},{"title":"Darrow · AI Washing Sparks Investor Suits and SEC Scrutiny","url":"https://www.darrow.ai/resources/ai-washing"},{"title":"AI-related securities class action filings are on the rise: Key observations | DLA Piper","url":"https://www.dlapiper.com/en-us/insights/publications/2025/09/ai-related-securities-class-action-filings-are-on-the-rise-key-observations"},{"title":"SEC emphasizes focus on “AI washing” despite perceived enforcement slowdown | DLA Piper","url":"https://www.dlapiper.com/en/insights/publications/ai-outlook/2025/sec-emphasizes-focus-on-ai-washing"},{"title":"Federal 'AI washing' enforcement likely to continue","url":"https://www.legaldive.com/news/federal-ai-washing-enforcement-likely-to-continue/738938/"},{"title":"More buzz than sting: The state of AI-related securities litigation","url":"https://www.wtwco.com/en-us/insights/2025/11/more-buzz-than-sting-the-state-of-ai-related-securities-litigation"},{"title":"AI Washing: Regulatory Scrutiny and