[2026-02-04T17:20:10.012Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DMigYHdocBvQ1UN7rF2wcR","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"C3.ai securities class action lawsuit August 2025 AI technology misrepresentation\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"AI 6-DAY DEADLINE ALERT: Investors Allege Misleading Statements in C3.ai (AI) Class Action Lawsuit-- Hagens Berman\",\"url\":\"https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20251015922683/en/AI-6-DAY-DEADLINE-ALERT-Investors-Allege-Misleading-Statements-in-C3.ai-AI-Class-Action-Lawsuit---Hagens-Berman\"},{\"title\":\"AI FINAL DEADLINE ALERT: Investors Allege Misleading Statements in C3.ai (AI) Class Action Lawsuit-- Hagens Berman\",\"url\":\"https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2025/10/20/3169596/32716/en/AI-FINAL-DEADLINE-ALERT-Investors-Allege-Misleading-Statements-in-C3-ai-AI-Class-Action-Lawsuit-Hagens-Berman.html\"},{\"title\":\"C3.ai, Inc. (AI) Hit With Securities Class Action After Shares Crash 25% On Large Revenue Miss -- Hagens Berman\",\"url\":\"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/c3ai-inc-ai-hit-with-securities-class-action-after-shares-crash-25-on-large-revenue-miss----hagens-berman-302543966.html\"},{\"title\":\"C3.ai, Inc. Class Action Lawsuit - AI\",\"url\":\"https://www.rgrdlaw.com/cases-c3-ai-class-action-lawsuit-ai.html\"},{\"title\":\"Investors Allege Misleading Statements in C3.ai (AI) Class Action Lawsuit -- Hagens Berman\",\"url\":\"https://natlawreview.com/press-releases/investors-allege-misleading-statements-c3ai-ai-class-action-lawsuit-hagens-1\"},{\"title\":\"CLASS ACTION REMINDER: Berger Montague Advises C3.ai, Inc. (NYSE: AI) Investors to Inquire About a Securities Fraud Lawsuit by October 21, 2025\",\"url\":\"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/class-action-reminder-berger-montague-advises-c3ai-inc-nyse-ai-investors-to-inquire-about-a-securities-fraud-lawsuit-by-october-21-2025-302569694.html\"},{\"title\":\"C3.AI INVESTOR NOTICE: C3.ai, Inc. Investors with Substantial Losses Have Opportunity to Lead Securities Class Action Lawsuit\",\"url\":\"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/c3ai-investor-notice-c3ai-inc-investors-with-substantial-losses-have-opportunity-to-lead-securities-class-action-lawsuit-302576800.html\"},{\"title\":\"C3.ai, Inc. (AI) Hit With Securities Class Action After Shares Crash 25% On Large Revenue Miss -- Hagens Berman\",\"url\":\"https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2025/09/08/3146531/32716/en/C3-ai-Inc-AI-Hit-With-Securities-Class-Action-After-Shares-Crash-25-On-Large-Revenue-Miss-Hagens-Berman.html\"},{\"title\":\"Investors Allege Misleading Statements in C3.ai (AI) Class Action Lawsuit-- Hagens Berman\",\"url\":\"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/investors-allege-misleading-statements-in-c3ai-ai-class-action-lawsuit---hagens-berman-302583232.html\"},{\"title\":\"C3.ai, Inc. (AI) Shareholders Who Lost Money Have Opportunity to Lead Securities Fraud Lawsuit | Morningstar\",\"url\":\"https://www.morningstar.com/news/pr-newswire/20251015la98943/c3ai-inc-ai-shareholders-who-lost-money-have-opportunity-to-lead-securities-fraud-lawsuit\"}]\n\nBased on the web search results, here's what I found about the C3.ai securities class action lawsuit:\n\n## Overview\n\nA class action lawsuit (Liggett v. C3.ai, Inc., No. 3:25-cv-07129 in the Northern District of California) has been filed against C3.ai investors who purchased or acquired C3.ai securities between February 26, 2025 and August 8, 2025.\n\n## Key Allegations\n\nAccording to the complaint, the company projected an overly optimistic picture of its revenue and growth potential. The lawsuit alleges that these projections downplayed the significant risk posed by CEO Thomas M. Siebel's health issues. The plaintiffs contend that C3.ai's public statements on growth and profitability were \"unrealistic\" and depended too heavily on the health and performance of its chief executive.\n\n## The Triggering Event\n\nInvestors learned the truth on August 8, 2025, when C3.ai announced preliminary Q1 2026 financial results that represented a whopping miss -- in contrast to revenue guidance of $100 million - $109 million given in May, the company reported preliminary revenue of $70.2 million to $70.4 million.\n\n## Legal Details\n\nInvestors who suffered substantial losses and are interested in serving as a lead plaintiff must file a motion with the court no later than October 21, 2025.\n\nNote that the lawsuit focuses on alleged misrepresentations regarding CEO health impacts on business performance, rather than on AI technology misrepresentation specifically.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ecff7720-544d-482b-91e9-9eb1a0db0dee","uuid":"4f486640-0611-45a3-8753-6d37b666fedf","tool_use_result":{"query":"C3.ai securities class action lawsuit August 2025 AI technology misrepresentation","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_016JuJe467Bt55jMytwnFzGQ","content":[{"title":"AI 6-DAY DEADLINE ALERT: Investors Allege Misleading Statements in C3.ai (AI) Class Action Lawsuit-- Hagens Berman","url":"https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20251015922683/en/AI-6-DAY-DEADLINE-ALERT-Investors-Allege-Misleading-Statements-in-C3.ai-AI-Class-Action-Lawsuit---Hagens-Berman"},{"title":"AI FINAL DEADLINE ALERT: Investors Allege Misleading Statements in C3.ai (AI) Class Action Lawsuit-- Hagens Berman","url":"https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2025/10/20/3169596/32716/en/AI-FINAL-DEADLINE-ALERT-Investors-Allege-Misleading-Statements-in-C3-ai-AI-Class-Action-Lawsuit-Hagens-Berman.html"},{"title":"C3.ai, Inc. (AI) Hit With Securities Class Action After Shares Crash 25% On Large Revenue Miss -- Hagens Berman","url":"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/c3ai-inc-ai-hit-with-securities-class-action-after-shares-crash-25-on-large-revenue-miss----hagens-berman-302543966.html"},{"title":"C3.ai, Inc. Class Action Lawsuit - AI","url":"https://www.rgrdlaw.com/cases-c3-ai-class-action-lawsuit-ai.html"},{"title":"Investors Allege Misleading Statements in C3.ai (AI) Class Action Lawsuit -- Hagens Berman","url":"https://natlawreview.com/press-releases/investors-allege-misleading-statements-c3ai-ai-class-action-lawsuit-hagens-1"},{"title":"CLASS ACTION REMINDER: Berger Montague Advises C3.ai, Inc. (NYSE: AI) Investors to Inquire About a Securities Fraud Lawsuit by October 21, 2025","url":"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/class-action-reminder-berger-montague-advises-c3ai-inc-nyse-ai-investors-to-inquire-about-a-securities-fraud-lawsuit-by-october-21-2025-302569694.html"},{"title":"C3.AI INVESTOR NOTICE: C3.ai, Inc. Investors with Substantial Losses Have Opportunity to Lead Securities Class Action Lawsuit","url":"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/c3ai-investor-notice-c3ai-inc-investors-with-substantial-losses-have-opportunity-to-lead-securities-class-action-lawsuit-302576800.html"},{"title":"C3.ai, Inc. (AI) Hit With Securities Class Action After Shares Crash 25% On Large Revenue Miss -- Hagens Berman","url":"https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2025/09/08/3146531/32716/en/C3-ai-Inc-AI-Hit-With-Securities-Class-Action-After-Shares-Crash-25-On-Large-Revenue-Miss-Hagens-Berman.html"},{"title":"Investors Allege Misleading Statements in C3.ai (AI) Class Action Lawsuit-- Hagens Berman","url":"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/investors-allege-misleading-statements-in-c3ai-ai-class-action-lawsuit---hagens-berman-302583232.html"},{"title":"C3.ai, Inc. (AI) Shareholders Who Lost Money Have Opportunity to Lead Securities Fraud Lawsuit | Morningstar","url":"https://www.morningstar.com/news/pr-newswire/20251015la98943/c3ai-inc-ai-shareholders-who-lost-money-have-opportunity-to-lead-securities-fraud-lawsuit"}]},"Based on the web search results, here's what I found about the C3.ai securities class action lawsuit:\n\n## Overview\n\nA class action lawsuit (Liggett v. C3.ai, Inc., No. 3:25-cv-07129 in the Northern District of California) has been filed against C3.ai investors who purchased or acquired C3.ai securities between February 26, 2025 and August 8, 2025.\n\n## Key Allegations\n\nAccording to the complaint, the company projected an overly optimistic picture of its revenue and growth potential. The lawsuit alleges that these projections downplayed the significant risk posed by CEO Thomas M. Siebel's health issues. The plaintiffs contend that C3.ai's public statements on growth and profitability were \"unrealistic\" and depended too heavily on the health and performance of its chief executive.\n\n## The Triggering Event\n\nInvestors learned the truth on August 8, 2025, when C3.ai announced preliminary Q1 2026 financial results that represented a whopping miss -- in contrast to revenue guidance of $100 million - $109 million given in May, the company reported preliminary revenue of $70.2 million to $70.4 million.\n\n## Legal Details\n\nInvestors who suffered substantial losses and are interested in serving as a lead plaintiff must file a motion with the court no later than October 21, 2025.\n\nNote that the lawsuit focuses on alleged misrepresentations regarding CEO health impacts on business performance, rather than on AI technology misrepresentation specifically."],"durationSeconds":8.453401900000012}}
[2026-02-04T17:20:10.432Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012y2qCDsWADA8ppVbLRM7Z6","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Innodata securities lawsuit Wolfpack Research AI smoke mirrors class action\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Innodata Securities Class Action Complaint\",\"url\":\"https://www.cohenmilstein.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Innodata-Securities-Class-Action-Complaint.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Artificial Intelligence or Artificial Claims? Exploring the Innodata Securities Litigation, Daniel Healy\",\"url\":\"https://briefings.brownrudnick.com/post/102j3wi/artificial-intelligence-or-artificial-claims-exploring-the-innodata-securities-l\"},{\"title\":\"Innodata Inc. Litigation Report | Levi & Korsinsky, LLP | Securities Class Action Attorneys\",\"url\":\"https://zlk.com/news/innodata-inc-litigation-report\"},{\"title\":\"Gainey McKenna & Egleston Announces A Class Action Lawsuit Has Been Filed Against Innodata Inc. (INOD)\",\"url\":\"https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2024/02/26/2835565/0/en/Gainey-McKenna-Egleston-Announces-A-Class-Action-Lawsuit-Has-Been-Filed-Against-Innodata-Inc-INOD.html\"},{\"title\":\"Innodata Inc. (INOD) Hit with Securities Class Action, Falls 30% on Claims of “AI Washing”– Hagens Berman\",\"url\":\"https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2024/04/17/2864808/32716/en/Innodata-Inc-INOD-Hit-with-Securities-Class-Action-Falls-30-on-Claims-of-AI-Washing-Hagens-Berman.html\"},{\"title\":\"INNODATA ALERT: Bragar Eagel & Squire, P.C. Announces that a Class Action Lawsuit Has Been Filed Against Innodata Inc. and Encourages Investors to Contact the Firm\",\"url\":\"https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2024/02/22/2833241/0/en/INNODATA-ALERT-Bragar-Eagel-Squire-P-C-Announces-that-a-Class-Action-Lawsuit-Has-Been-Filed-Against-Innodata-Inc-and-Encourages-Investors-to-Contact-the-Firm.html\"},{\"title\":\"Innodata Shareholder Lawsuit Filed By Block & Leviton – Investors Who Have Lost Money Should Contact The Firm\",\"url\":\"https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2024/04/16/2863969/23044/en/Innodata-Shareholder-Lawsuit-Filed-By-Block-Leviton-Investors-Who-Have-Lost-Money-Should-Contact-The-Firm.html\"},{\"title\":\"SHAREHOLDER ALERT: Pomerantz Law Firm Announces the Filing of a Class Action Against Innodata Inc. - INOD\",\"url\":\"https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2024/03/07/2842652/0/en/SHAREHOLDER-ALERT-Pomerantz-Law-Firm-Announces-the-Filing-of-a-Class-Action-Against-Innodata-Inc-INOD.html\"},{\"title\":\"INNODATA ALERT: Bragar Eagel & Squire, P.C. Announces that a Class Action Lawsuit Has Been Filed Against Innodata Inc. and Encourages Investors to Contact the Firm\",\"url\":\"https://www.streetinsider.com/Globe+Newswire/INNODATA+ALERT:+Bragar+Eagel+&+Squire,+P.C.+Announces+that+a+Class+Action+Lawsuit+Has+Been+Filed+Against+Innodata+Inc.+and+Encourages+Investors+to+Contact+the+Firm/22813345.html\"},{\"title\":\"Innodata Suit Highlights 'AI Washing' Liability Risk for Cos.\",\"url\":\"https://www.bracewell.com/resources/innodata-suit-highlights-ai-washing-liability-risk-cos/\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's an overview of the Innodata securities lawsuit related to Wolfpack Research's \"AI smoke and mirrors\" report:\n\n## Summary\n\nA securities class action lawsuit was filed in the United States District Court for the District of New Jersey on behalf of all persons or entities who purchased or otherwise acquired Innodata Inc. securities between May 9, 2019 through February 14, 2024.\n\n## The Wolfpack Research Report\n\nOn February 15, 2024, Wolfpack Research published a report revealing that Innodata misrepresented the nature and extent of its business and operations. The Wolfpack Report purported to show that Innodata's AI is really \"smoke and mirrors\" and compared the Company's marketing claims to \"putting lipstick on a pig.\" The report contended that Innodata's purported AI initiative was predominantly \"smoke and mirrors,\" relying heavily on low-wage offshore labor rather than proprietary AI technology.\n\n## Key Allegations\n\nThe complaint alleges Defendants made false and/or misleading statements, as well as failed to disclose material facts, including that Innodata: (1) did not have a viable AI technology; (2) its Goldengate AI platform is a rudimentary software developed by just a handful of employees; (3) it was not going to utilize AI to any significant degree for new Silicon Valley contracts; (4) it was not effectively investing in research and development for AI.\n\nThe Company also stopped disclosing its Research and Development (R&D) spend after the first quarter of 2021. The Wolfpack Report highlighted that Innodata's total investment in R&D over the past five years was only $4.4 million, with even less allocated to R&D in 2023 than what the Company spent promoting its \"AI\" technology through press releases.\n\n## Stock Price Impact\n\nOn this news, Innodata's stock price fell $3.74 per share, or 30.5%, to close at $8.52 per share on February 15, 2024.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ecff7720-544d-482b-91e9-9eb1a0db0dee","uuid":"f2223f4e-d89b-4dc0-afc1-ebddd5567d05","tool_use_result":{"query":"Innodata securities lawsuit Wolfpack Research AI smoke mirrors class action","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01569Q3MjiEd71k4zBBnTwsb","content":[{"title":"Innodata Securities Class Action Complaint","url":"https://www.cohenmilstein.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Innodata-Securities-Class-Action-Complaint.pdf"},{"title":"Artificial Intelligence or Artificial Claims? Exploring the Innodata Securities Litigation, Daniel Healy","url":"https://briefings.brownrudnick.com/post/102j3wi/artificial-intelligence-or-artificial-claims-exploring-the-innodata-securities-l"},{"title":"Innodata Inc. Litigation Report | Levi & Korsinsky, LLP | Securities Class Action Attorneys","url":"https://zlk.com/news/innodata-inc-litigation-report"},{"title":"Gainey McKenna & Egleston Announces A Class Action Lawsuit Has Been Filed Against Innodata Inc. (INOD)","url":"https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2024/02/26/2835565/0/en/Gainey-McKenna-Egleston-Announces-A-Class-Action-Lawsuit-Has-Been-Filed-Against-Innodata-Inc-INOD.html"},{"title":"Innodata Inc. (INOD) Hit with Securities Class Action, Falls 30% on Claims of “AI Washing”– Hagens Berman","url":"https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2024/04/17/2864808/32716/en/Innodata-Inc-INOD-Hit-with-Securities-Class-Action-Falls-30-on-Claims-of-AI-Washing-Hagens-Berman.html"},{"title":"INNODATA ALERT: Bragar Eagel & Squire, P.C. Announces that a Class Action Lawsuit Has Been Filed Against Innodata Inc. and Encourages Investors to Contact the Firm","url":"https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2024/02/22/2833241/0/en/INNODATA-ALERT-Bragar-Eagel-Squire-P-C-Announces-that-a-Class-Action-Lawsuit-Has-Been-Filed-Against-Innodata-Inc-and-Encourages-Investors-to-Contact-the-Firm.html"},{"title":"Innodata Shareholder Lawsuit Filed By Block & Leviton – Investors Who Have Lost Money Should Contact The Firm","url":"https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2024/04/16/2863969/23044/en/Innodata-Shareholder-Lawsuit-Filed-By-Block-Leviton-Investors-Who-Have-Lost-Money-Should-Contact-The-Firm.html"},{"title":"SHAREHOLDER ALERT: Pomerantz Law Firm Announces the Filing of a Class Action Against Innodata Inc. - INOD","url":"https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2024/03/07/2842652/0/en/SHAREHOLDER-ALERT-Pomerantz-Law-Firm-Announces-the-Filing-of-a-Class-Action-Against-Innodata-Inc-INOD.html"},{"title":"INNODATA ALERT: Bragar Eagel & Squire, P.C. Announces that a Class Action Lawsuit Has Been Filed Against Innodata Inc. and Encourages Investors to Contact the Firm","url":"https://www.streetinsider.com/Globe+Newswire/INNODATA+ALERT:+Bragar+Eagel+&+Squire,+P.C.+Announces+that+a+Class+Action+Lawsuit+Has+Been+Filed+Against+Innodata+Inc.+and+Encourages+Investors+to+Contact+the+Firm/22813345.html"},{"title":"Innodata Suit Highlights 'AI Washing' Liability Risk for Cos.","url":"https://www.bracewell.com/resources/innodata-suit-highlights-ai-washing-liability-risk-cos/"}]},"Based on the search results, here's an overview of the Innodata securities lawsuit related to Wolfpack Research's \"AI smoke and mirrors\" report:\n\n## Summary\n\nA securities class action lawsuit was filed in the United States District Court for the District of New Jersey on behalf of all persons or entities who purchased or otherwise acquired Innodata Inc. securities between May 9, 2019 through February 14, 2024.\n\n## The Wolfpack Research Report\n\nOn February 15, 2024, Wolfpack Research published a report revealing that Innodata misrepresented the nature and extent of its business and operations. The Wolfpack Report purported to show that Innodata's AI is really \"smoke and mirrors\" and compared the Company's marketing claims to \"putting lipstick on a pig.\" The report contended that Innodata's purported AI initiative was predominantly \"smoke and mirrors,\" relying heavily on low-wage offshore labor rather than proprietary AI technology.\n\n## Key Allegations\n\nThe complaint alleges Defendants made false and/or misleading statements, as well as failed to disclose material facts, including that Innodata: (1) did not have a viable AI technology; (2) its Goldengate AI platform is a rudimentary software developed by just a handful of employees; (3) it was not going to utilize AI to any significant degree for new Silicon Valley contracts; (4) it was not effectively investing in research and development for AI.\n\nThe Company also stopped disclosing its Research and Development (R&D) spend after the first quarter of 2021. The Wolfpack Report highlighted that Innodata's total investment in R&D over the past five years was only $4.4 million, with even less allocated to R&D in 2023 than what the Company spent promoting its \"AI\" technology through press releases.\n\n## Stock Price Impact\n\nOn this news, Innodata's stock price fell $3.74 per share, or 30.5%, to close at $8.52 per share on February 15, 2024."],"durationSeconds":8.13348139999999}}
